{"title":"Crab","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"crab-meat\" title=\"Crab Meat - in 4 of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 11 total, 2–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b93e65f14c94695cc733.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Crab Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2–3</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1663.2px,-705.2px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/5/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/5/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/6/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/6/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/7/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/7/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:768px\"><i style=\"left:1656.7px;top:676.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1662.3px;top:641.2px\"></i><i style=\"left